### STEP 11 — EntryGate

```java
public class EntryGate {
    private String     gateId;
    private ParkingLot parkingLot;

    public EntryGate(String gateId, ParkingLot lot) {
        this.gateId     = gateId;
        this.parkingLot = lot;
    }

    public Ticket entry(Vehicle vehicle) {

        // 1. Find available spot across all floors
        ParkingSpot spot =
            parkingLot.findAvailableSpot(vehicle);

        // 2. No spot found → parking full
        if (spot == null) {
            throw new RuntimeException(
                "Parking Full! No spot for "
                + vehicle.getVehicleType());
        }

        // 3. Assign vehicle to spot
        spot.assignVehicle(vehicle);

        // 4. Update display board
        parkingLot.getDisplayBoard()
                  .update(parkingLot.getFloors());

        // 5. Generate ticket
        Ticket ticket = new Ticket(vehicle, spot);
        System.out.println("Entry done. Ticket: "
            + ticket.getTicketId()
            + " | Spot: " + spot.getSpotId());

        return ticket;
    }
}
```

